{"5016300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bottle Immortal", "steam_appid": 5016300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottle Immortal is a single-player, turn-based cultivation RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world threatened by turbidity, gather resources, and manage the risks that build up during exploration and combat. Return to the Bottle Realm to cleanse turbidity, cultivate your party, craft medicines, and prepare for the next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and develop cultivators from different races and professions. Combine their talents, artifacts, and turn-based tactics to survive dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current demo focuses on world-map exploration, turbidity management, Bottle Realm progression, party growth, and story battles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottle Immortal is a single-player, turn-based cultivation RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world threatened by turbidity, gather resources, and manage the risks that build up during exploration and combat. Return to the Bottle Realm to cleanse turbidity, cultivate your party, craft medicines, and prepare for the next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and develop cultivators from different races and professions. Combine their talents, artifacts, and turn-based tactics to survive dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current demo focuses on world-map exploration, turbidity management, Bottle Realm progression, party growth, and story battles.</p>", "short_description": "Bottle Immortal is a 3D top-down, single-player, turn-based strategy RPG. Explore a cultivation world, recruit companions, and build your party. Master the Five Elements, combine skills and artifacts on grid-based battlefields, manage Turbidity, and return to the Bottle Realm to recover.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese